# Testing

`uv run pytest` must pass before a phase is marked done. GPU tests use the `gpu` marker and are excluded from that command.

Property tests use Hypothesis. When function-preserving edits exist, at least one property test asserts the output is unchanged at a zero-parameter morphism, on CPU, over random inputs.

Tests do not read `results/` and do not download datasets.

A test that only checks a mock of the ledger is not enough for a gate or an edit. Round-trip a real temporary Parquet file.
